 "prepText": "AURON · 2 OF 3 “Your party is ready.” The tabs are for later. Start the battle. ESC SKIP THE GUIDE PARTY PREP EXP · YUNA'S BALLAD — DEN OF WOE — UNDER MUSHROOM ROCK ROAD Y Yuna LV 54 CHAPTER DRESSPHERES STATS ACCESSORIES ITEMS FFX-2 · EXP Yuna's Ballad Two friends who cannot see her, and one girl who will not look away The pyreflies in the sealed cave have taken Rikku and Paine, and each of them thinks Yuna is a guard with a gun. There is no one else to stand in front of them. Two fights, no rest between, and the same girl at the end of both. the sealed cave alone at the front a slow blade OBJECTIVES Survive a Grenade Free Rikku Free Paine TIP Nothing heals between the duels. Rikku's throws never vary in size; Paine has thick armour and thin magic defence. START BATTLE Y Yuna LV 54 · 13 DRESSPHERES WHITE MAGE",
